    "path": "README.md",
    "line": 295,
    "text": "Manuscript-selected publication artifacts are tracked under `paper/figures/`. Figures 1-6 cover the workflow, structural overview, magnetic domain, MP-only magnetic-reference screening and DFT validation, energy-magnetism landscape, and diversity/adaptation analysis. Figure 8 is a provisional multi-objective comparison documented in the figure directory. PCA loadings and the updated descriptor-space PCA are supplementary figures. Historical publication artifacts are retained under `paper/figures/legacy/`; exploratory previews, audits, projections, and regenerated figures remain under `reproduced/`."
  },
